Team of 7 - 00:42:00<br/>
Team of 8 - 00:42:00<br/>
Team of 9 - 00:42:00<br/>
Team of 10 - 00:42:00<br/>
Team of 11-15 - 00:45:00<br/>
Team of 16-23 - 01:00:00<br/>
Team of 24+ - 01:20:00

''As with any update involving large groups of players, our balancing is preliminary and may change based on the data that you as players generate.''

In addition to the above, completing 100, 200, 500, 1000 and 2000 Challenge Mode raids will grant you access to a range of new capes which can be claimed from Rimor, who is located just outside the entrance to the Chambers of Xeric. 

[[File:Chambers of Xeric- Challenge Mode Is Here! (7).jpg|center|700px]]
<center>''The capes can be mounted in the PoH and added to the Cape Rack.
''</center>

